handling and tool set were reworked; new tools, discovery over HTTP, automatic port selection and reconnect handling were
added; the packages under packages/ are reconstructions of runtime modules that the upstream server inlines in its
published npm bundle (@browsermcp/mcp@0.1.3). Every modified file is identifiable from the git history of this
repository (base commit c29e923 is the unmodified upstream server), and the published npm file (jolt-server.mjs)
begins with a header saying it is derived from, and modified from, the upstream work.

The baseline/ directory is the upstream server's source, kept only as the reference for benchmarks and compatibility
tests. Its README and banner image (upstream branding) were removed; the source files are unmodified.

apps/extension is an independent implementation written for this project. It does not contain code, icons, names or
